  "body": "Sometimes ART crashes when I change to an other directory via double click on the directory tree. I can not reproduce it, sometimes days go by until it happens again. But I was able to catch one in debug with the latest master code. At Inspector::switchImage inspector.cc 681 there is only one item in ```entry``` but ```ilo``` is 95. See screenshot below:\n\n<img width=\"1604\" height=\"976\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/174f8660-b196-4574-a33c-c8ec2398177a\" />",
